{"series":{"id":"spare-me-great-lord","slug":"spare-me-great-lord","title":"Spare Me Great Lord","image":"https://donghualife.com/sites/default/files/styles/node_series/public/2025-03/008aAR9Ily1hl8gc3pwqnj31hc0u0tjg.jpg?itok=X_HPsQvE","synopsis":"Esta es la historia de un huérfano, Lu Shu. No es un huérfano común, sino un metahumano que experimenta los cambios en sí mismo, su país y el mundo durante el amanecer de la era mágica. Mira cómo Lu Shu se embarca en un viaje para perfeccionar sus peculiares habilidades junto con su hermana, la adorable y carismática Lu Xiaoyu. En el camino, se encontrarán con eventos sobrenaturales, obstáculos e incluso con las personas más poderosas de su país. ¿Cómo sacará Lu Shu lo mejor de sus habilidades y expulsará a su interminable lista de rivales y oponentes?","status":"En Emisión","year":2021,"genres":[],"type":"donghua","src":"donghualife","sourceUrls":["https://donghualife.com/series/spare-me-great-lord"],"updatedAt":"2026-09-19T17:20:12.593Z"},"seasons":[{"id":"spare-me-great-lord-t1","slug":"spare-me-great-lord-t1","seriesId":"spare-me-great-lord","number":1,"image":"https://donghualife.com/sites/default/files/styles/node_series/public/2025-03/008aAR9Ily1hl8gc3pwqnj31hc0u0tjg.jpg?itok=X_HPsQvE","updatedAt":"2026-09-19T17:20:12.593Z","episodeCount":12},{"id":"spare-me-great-lord-t2","slug":"spare-me-great-lord-t2","seriesId":"spare-me-great-lord","number":2,"image":"https://donghualife.com/sites/default/files/styles/node_series/public/2025-03/008aAR9Ily1hl8gc3pwqnj31hc0u0tjg.jpg?itok=X_HPsQvE","updatedAt":"2026-09-19T17:20:12.593Z","episodeCount":12}],"episodes":[{"id":"spare-me-great-lord-t1-e12","slug":"spare-me-great-lord-t1-e12","title":"spare-me-great-lord-1-episodio-x12","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/episode/spare-me-great-lord-1-episodio-x12","servers":[{"name":"dailymotion.com","url":"https://www.dailymotion.com/embed/video/k2MRQldA2DKBxrAsWnu","embed":true},{"name":"ok.ru","url":"https://ok.ru/videoembed/42601